<title>FRANCE: Suez unit sells Dauphin OTA stake.</title>
<headline>Suez unit sells Dauphin OTA stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie de Suez unit Suez Industrie sold to institutional investors for about 100 million francs its entire 10 percent stake in Dauphin OTA, Suez said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the sale would result in a capital gain in Cie de Suez's consolidated accounts but did not specify the size of the gain.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
